# Layout of the desktop and the panel, written out in full instead of being generated on
# the first login. It is the layout the shell generates by default, with these changes:
#   * the desktop uses the solid-colour wallpaper plugin with one fixed neutral colour
#     (Containment 1, Color = 128,128,128; the harness treats this value as a constant)
#   * the task manager launchers and the favourites of the application launcher are
#     fixed (no "preferred browser" entry, no application store entry), so the panel and
#     the launcher look the same whatever else is installed. The launcher reads the
#     "favorites" list once at its first start and moves it into its own database
#     (that is what the shell does with its default list as well).
#   * the network applet is removed from the system tray (its state, "no connection",
#     is of no interest and can flicker while the network service starts)
# The activity id must equal the one in kactivitymanagerdrc.
# Regenerate it after a change of the pinned Plasma version: see harness/vm/README.md.

